// "Prairie Pompon": a meadow with a hill, the opening circuit (issue #3, redrawn for issue #108
// after the guide « Conception des circuits », docs/GAME_DESIGN.md § 16). Original layout, about
// 1380 m a lap (1370 before #193), turning right, easy and flowing, but with turns to drift: the
// start straight; three hairpins (right, left, right) up the Butte, a hill 6.5 m high; on top, a
// tight left turn and the corner of the risky jump, its inside a drop; a bulge whose hidden road
// runs straight behind a hedge; down the Butte; two hairpins (right, left) in the meadow; a tight
// right turn and the last corner, across which the grass path cuts. Five hairpins of 200° to
// 217° (a Normal bot drifts them; each one after a straight long enough for its last mini-turbo
// to be over; each one begins or ends in a little kink the other way, which a drift goes
// through), four tight turns of 90°, an S: no long soft curve, one long straight. The circuit of
// issue #3 is the test circuit of the unit tests now (`src/track/test_circuit.track.ron`).
//
// Drawn as a plan of straights and arcs, its points every 8 m along it (the parameters below
// follow them; issue #193: 7.7 to 8.8 m in the three hairpins redrawn, the same number of
// points).
//
// Format: see src/track/data.rs. Positions along the track ("at", "from", "to") are spline
// parameters: 9.5 = halfway between points 9 and 10. Lateral "offset" goes from -1 (left
// edge of the road) to 1 (right edge). Point 0 is the start line; karts drive toward point 1.
(
    name: "Prairie Pompon",
    // Dressing (issue #11): a meadow with a racing circuit's furniture (`assets/data/biomes.ron`),
    // the same every time (seed), and pieces placed by hand (`props`: a model, where along the
    // track, which side, its height and footprint in meters, its gap beyond the walls): a hedge
    // that hides the hidden road, giant trees on the Butte, grandstands along the grid, the
    // checkered flags at the start line (beyond the posts of its arch, issue #79), banner towers.
    biome: "Prairie",
    // Issue #104: its music (`assets/data/music.ron`).
    music: "pure-raceway",
    decor_seed: 11,
    props: [
        (model: "racing-kit/grandStandCovered", at: 168.754, side: Left, height: 6.0, radius: 3.8, gap: 1.0),
        (model: "racing-kit/grandStandCovered", at: 167.257, side: Left, height: 6.0, radius: 3.8, gap: 1.0),
        (model: "racing-kit/flagCheckers", at: 0.0, side: Both, height: 4.5, radius: 0.8, gap: 1.8),
        (model: "racing-kit/bannerTowerRed", at: 13.474, side: Left, height: 6.0, radius: 1.6, gap: 0.5),
        (model: "racing-kit/bannerTowerGreen", at: 38.713, side: Right, height: 6.0, radius: 1.6, gap: 0.5),
        // The hedge inside the bulge: the hidden road runs behind it (bushes: nothing high
        // stands inside a tight turn, GD § 14).
